+class _P2Feeder:
+    """P2 writer thread. Tasks are (forward, layer, group) in forward order;
+    each is: host buffer free -> kt-kernel write (GIL free) -> wait until the
+    main thread has recorded compute_done of the slot's previous group ->
+    DMA into slot gi % S -> publish. Host-side counters order every CUDA
+    event record before the wait that uses it."""
